How to load it (Firefox)
Save both files into a folder, e.g. chatgpt-export-overlay-mvp/.
Open about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox.
Click Load Temporary Add-on… and select the manifest.json in that folder.
Open a conversation at https://chatgpt.com/... or https://chat.openai.com/....
You should see a circular Export button in the bottom-right.
Click it → alert + console log.
Scroll / resize → it stays put and nudges above the composer if needed.
If you want tweaks (offsets, size), change the values at the top of content.js in the CFG object.

